{"articleNo":"69543","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=69543&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[LINC사업단] 2012-2학기 해외신기술 견학 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.09","hit":"5307","attachments":[{"name":"(공고용)해외신기술견학 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=69543&attachNo=72125"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--> </p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">[LINC] 2012-2학기 해외신기술 견학 모집 안내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 목&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 적 :해외 신기술 견학을 통해 최신 기술 동향을 파악하고 글로벌 역량을 강화</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 시&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 기 : 동계방학중(2013.01.29 ~ 2013.02.01 : 3박4일간)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 방문지역 : 일본 동경 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 정 : 지구환경박람회, 동경대학, 업체방문 등(추후공지예정)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 예상인원 : 총 80명 중 65명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 상 : 응용수학과를 제외한 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학부 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 예&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 산 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">일인당 115만원 가량(박람회비, 여행자보험, 왕복 항공료, 체재비 등)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">개인부담</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">20만원</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(총금액의 20%), 개인경비는 별도(여권포함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 제출서류 : 해외신기술견학 신청서, 본인통장사본, 공인어학성적표(토익점수만 가능)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 신청방법 : 제출서류를 그린에너지관 401호에 제출</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 11. 07(수) ~ 2012. 11. 23(금) 18:00 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">까지 신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 선발방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">마일리지점수</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(LINC사업단 11월 30일 기준 예정)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">, 동점자일 경우 어학성적순, LINC사업단 프로그램 수상내역 가산점 합산함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(단, 학부/전공 배분 없음)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 선발일자 : 2012. 12. 03(월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"77\" valign=\"center\" width=\"185\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">참여제한 및 신청불가</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"77\" valign=\"center\" width=\"408\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">1) 2012년 2학기 휴학자(예정자)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2) 해외여행에 결격 사유가 있는 자</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"147\" valign=\"center\" width=\"185\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">주의 사항</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"147\" valign=\"center\" width=\"408\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">1) LINC 사업단 참여기간 중 단 1번만 지원함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2) 반드시 견학 전 오리엔테이션에 참가해야함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3) 여권사본을 제출하지 않으면 자격 상실</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">4) 취소시 항공료 등 경비에 대한 위약금은 개인이 부담</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"81\" valign=\"center\" width=\"185\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">의무 사항</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"81\" valign=\"center\" width=\"408\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">귀국 후 7일 이내 결과 보고서 제출</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">여권사본 1부(출국 도장 확인란, 성명 사진 부분)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -44pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">○ 세부일정과 오리엔테이션 일정등 자세한 사항은 추후 공고될 예정입니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">☏ 문의사항 478-7974</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
